  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PAR - Let the Women Explain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to improve the results and impact in Part II and further
contribute to the empowerment of women in Turkey. Women in Turkey are facing a large number of problems from physical violence at home, abuse at workplace to discrimination in economic life. Representation of women in public space is yet one of the areas where women cannot find a fair place. The project &#x201c;Let the Women Explain&#x201d; aims to address this underrepresentation problem in public space through a number of activities including new channels and trends.</narrative>
  </description>
